---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { Download, Terminal, CheckCircle2, AlertTriangle, Shield, ArrowRight, Copy } from 'lucide-react';
---

<Layout
  title="Installation & Setup Guide | Flowmator Chrome Extension"
  description="Step-by-step installation instructions for Flowmator. Learn how to load the unpacked extension in Chrome Developer Mode and run your first verified Google Flow prompt queue."
>
  <div class="px-4 py-12 md:py-20 max-w-4xl mx-auto space-y-14">
    
    {/* Page Title */}
    <div class="text-center space-y-4">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3.5 py-1 rounded-full glass-tier3 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-aqua-liquid">
        Quick Setup Guide
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-extrabold text-white tracking-tight">
        Install & Run Flowmator
      </h1>
      <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-brandText-secondary max-w-xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">
        Follow our quick walkthrough to load the extension in Chrome and launch your first verified prompt queue in under 3 minutes.
      </p>
    </div>

    {/* Installation Path Cards */}
    <div class="space-y-10">
      
      {/* Path B: Developer Unpacked Mode (Primary for local build) */}
      <div class="glass-tier2 rounded-3xl p-6 md:p-10 border border-white/15 space-y-6">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between pb-4 border-b border-white/10">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
            <div class="p-2.5 rounded-xl bg-violet-600/20 text-aqua-liquid border border-violet-500/30">
              <Terminal className="w-5 h-5" />
            </div>
            <div>
              <span class="text-[11px] font-mono text-aqua-liquid uppercase">Standard Method</span>
              <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white">Load Unpacked Extension (Developer Mode)</h2>
            </div>
          </div>
          <span class="text-xs px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full bg-emerald-500/10 text-emerald-300 border border-emerald-500/20 font-mono">
            Active v1.0.0
          </span>
        </div>

        <ol class="space-y-4">
          {[
            {
              num: "1",
              title: "Obtain the Flowmator Folder",
              desc: "Locate the flow-automator directory containing manifest.json on your computer."
            },
            {
              num: "2",
              title: "Open Chrome Extensions Manager",
              desc: "Open Google Chrome and navigate to chrome://extensions in the address bar."
            },
            {
              num: "3",
              title: "Enable Developer Mode",
              desc: "Toggle the Developer mode switch located in the upper-right corner of the Extensions page."
            },
            {
              num: "4",
              title: "Click 'Load unpacked'",
              desc: "Click the 'Load unpacked' button in the top-left toolbar and select the flow-automator folder."
            },
            {
              num: "5",
              title: "Pin Flowmator to Toolbar",
              desc: "Click the puzzle-piece icon in your Chrome toolbar and pin Flowmator for one-click access."
            }
          ].map((step) => (
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-xs md:text-sm text-brandText-secondary">
              <span class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-violet-600/30 text-white font-mono text-xs font-bold flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 border border-violet-400/30 mt-0.5">
                {step.num}
              </span>
              <div>
                <strong class="text-white block">{step.title}</strong>
                <span>{step.desc}</span>
              </div>
            </li>
          ))}
        </ol>

        <div class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-graphite-900/80 border border-white/10 space-y-2">
          <div class="text-xs font-semibold text-white">Copyable Chrome Address:</div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between p-2 rounded-xl bg-black/40 font-mono text-xs text-aqua-liquid">
            <span>chrome://extensions</span>
            <span class="text-[10px] text-brandText-tertiary">Paste into address bar</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      {/* Path A: Published Chrome Web Store Notice */}
      <div class="glass-tier3 rounded-3xl p-6 md:p-8 border border-white/10 space-y-3">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
          <Download className="w-5 h-5 text-violet-electric" />
          <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-white">Chrome Web Store Distribution</h3>
        </div>
        <p class="text-xs text-brandText-secondary leading-relaxed">
          The public Chrome Web Store package is currently prepared under Manifest V3 guidelines. Until official store verification is published, developers and beta creators can run Flowmator locally via the unpacked instructions above with 100% feature parity.
        </p>
      </div>

      {/* Permissions Breakdown in Plain English */}
      <div class="glass-tier2 rounded-3xl p-6 md:p-8 border border-white/15 space-y-5">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
          <Shield className="w-5 h-5 text-emerald-400" />
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white">Extension Permissions Explained</h3>
        </div>
        <p class="text-xs text-brandText-secondary leading-relaxed">
          Flowmator strictly requests the minimum Chrome permissions required to automate prompt sequences safely:
        </p>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-3 text-xs">
          <div class="p-3 rounded-xl bg-graphite-900/60 border border-white/5 space-y-1">
            <span class="font-mono text-aqua-liquid font-semibold">sidePanel</span>
            <p class="text-brandText-tertiary">Renders the tactile control panel alongside Google Flow without obscuring your canvas.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="p-3 rounded-xl bg-graphite-900/60 border border-white/5 space-y-1">
            <span class="font-mono text-aqua-liquid font-semibold">debugger</span>
            <p class="text-brandText-tertiary">Dispatches hardware-level isTrusted: true keyboard and click events into the ProseMirror editor.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="p-3 rounded-xl bg-graphite-900/60 border border-white/5 space-y-1">
            <span class="font-mono text-aqua-liquid font-semibold">scripting</span>
            <p class="text-brandText-tertiary">Inspects DOM image tags and error tiles in Google Flow's main page world.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="p-3 rounded-xl bg-graphite-900/60 border border-white/5 space-y-1">
            <span class="font-mono text-aqua-liquid font-semibold">storage</span>
            <p class="text-brandText-tertiary">Saves prompt queues and custom delay settings locally inside your Chrome profile.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      {/* First Run Walkthrough */}
      <div class="glass-tier2 rounded-3xl p-6 md:p-8 border border-white/15 space-y-4">
        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white">Your First 2-Prompt Test Queue</h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-brandText-secondary leading-relaxed">
          To verify that your installation is working correctly:
        </p>
        <ol class="list-decimal list-inside space-y-2 text-xs text-brandText-secondary">
          <li>Navigate to <a href="https://flow.google.com" target="_blank" class="text-aqua-liquid underline">flow.google.com</a> and sign in with your Google account.</li>
          <li>Click the Flowmator extension icon to open the side panel. Confirm that the top indicator shows <strong class="text-emerald-400">● Flow Connected</strong>.</li>
          <li>Paste two test prompts separated by a blank line or <code class="text-white font-mono">@@@NEXT@@@</code>.</li>
          <li>Keep <strong class="text-white">Safe Sequence Mode</strong> selected and click <strong class="text-violet-electric">Start Flowmator Sequence</strong>.</li>
          <li>Watch the side panel status transition from <em>Generating</em> to <em>Verifying</em> to <em>Completed</em> as Google Flow finishes rendering.</li>
        </ol>
      </div>

    </div>

    {/* Need Help Banner */}
    <div class="text-center space-y-3 pt-4">
      <p class="text-xs text-brandText-secondary">Encountering an issue during setup?</p>
      <div class="flex justify-center gap-4">
        <a href="/documentation/troubleshooting" class="text-xs text-aqua-liquid hover:underline font-semibold">
          Troubleshooting Guide ➔
        </a>
        <a href="/support" class="text-xs text-brandText-secondary hover:text-white">
          Support Center
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</Layout>
